    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51-a4">

                <pb facs="0160" n="56" xml:id="pg56"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 143.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Houston to Mr.
                            Adee</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-23"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 23,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Following telegram has just been received from our agent in Guatemala via
                    Acapulco, Mexico:</p>
                <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">Colima</hi> sailed July 18.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. B. Houston</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
